# Persistent 32K-context build of qwen3.6:27b for the McMiner pseudotrack runs.
#
# Why: Ollama's default context window is far smaller than these prompts. A
# McMiner-M bag is 5 pseudocode solutions (~1.3KB each) plus problem text, and
# the RAG+REF arm adds 3 retrieved examples and an APR reference on top —
# roughly 10K tokens before the model writes a word. Overflow is TRUNCATED
# SILENTLY: you get plausible-looking output mined from a clipped prompt.
#
# Build it:
#     ollama create qwen3.6-mcminer -f Modelfile
# Then point the scripts at it:
#     MODEL=qwen3.6-mcminer bash run_all.sh
#
# Alternative (no derived model, applies server-wide):
#     OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH=32768 ollama serve

FROM qwen3.6:27b

PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
